                    },
                    "message": "Consider using std::format instead of std::ostringstream. It is faster and creates a smaller binary.\n```\nstd::string hexCode = std::format(\"0x{:02x}{:02x}{:02x}{:02x}\",\n                                  codeClass, subClass,\n                                  operation2nd, operation1st);\n```"
